      "data": {
        "text": "\"Task specifications (listed alphabetically; implement only the requested file):\nbatch_translate.py - translates a list of strings while preserving order\nlocalized_audio_preview.py - Generate spoken previews of translated copy\nquality_summary.py - Summarize translation quality issues\ntranslate_dictionary_values.py - translates dictionary values while preserving keys\ntranslate_markup.py - translates HTML or markup while preserving tags\ntranslate_text.py - translates a single text string between languages\ntranslation_client.py - Provide local configuration and client helper utilities for General Text Translation\ntranslation_memory_embedding.py - Embed translated segments for translation-memory search\ntranslation_models.py - Define local request, response, and normalization helpers for General Text Translation\nunsafe_copy_check.py - Check localized copy for unsafe content\n\nCreate translate_text.py in the current working directory.\nTask: translates a single text string between languages.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
